# graphify for the Linux guest (umbra-pack install graph): graphifyy and everything it imports, pinned to the exact
# wheels for Debian trixie on arm64 (CPython 3.13, manylinux aarch64), each by SHA-256. pip refuses anything else.
# Regenerate (on any machine): pip download graphifyy==<v> -d wheels --only-binary=:all: --python-version 313
#   --implementation cp --abi cp313 --platform manylinux_2_28_aarch64 --platform manylinux2014_aarch64 --platform any
# and write one "name==version --hash=sha256:<sha256 of the wheel>" line per wheel.
